Z||000009||Standard||11-22-2001||04:40 PM||||All of my Fiero's have been daily drivers.  My quad had 50,000 miles on it when I got it in july, and now it has almost 59,000.  I got my GT with 142,000 on it and it's up to 165,000 now.  Why buy 'em if you aren't gonna drive 'em?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">          <BR><FONT COLOR="red">1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed</FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="white">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
